{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "action" %}
{# DeD Tattoos — visible-mark facts. INFORMATIVE ONLY, never directive.
   The VISIBLE-ONLY ruling (REV-157 exchange): marks key on the
   ResolveVisibility cascade's layer-1 truth ONLY — covered marks render
   nothing, and the subject's own marks are the SELF branch. Marks the
   bio's subject can see on OTHERS = the OTHER branch (first visibly
   marked actor in the subject's cell; the module carries section + name
   + location per visible mark, resolved fresh per render). Brace-balanced.

   REV-157 (2026-10-24) — the 0175 mold applied to SlaveTats. Lane
   conventions transcribed exactly: the bio lane's actor variable is
   actorUUID (0171 precedent); every read is guarded (default() +
   isNumber / isArray) so no loop or comparison can see null/undefined;
   present false renders nothing. NULL CONTRACT (psc side, REV-157):
   get_ded_marks always returns well-formed JSON — {"present": false}
   under every absent-framework state; the marks array is always a
   well-formed (possibly empty) array of section/name/area objects;
   visibility is resolved per render (a covered mark one render may be
   exposed the next — no staleness).
   Branch texts below are STRATEGIST DRAFT (register entry 36) — the
   user's ruling gates INSTALL; first enabled render IS the probe
   (clean = LIVE; error box = escalate). #}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 %}
{% set marks = get_ded_marks(actorUUID) %}
{% if marks and marks.present %}
{% if marks.self %}
## Your Body
{% if existsIn(marks, "marks") and isArray(marks.marks) %}
{% for mk in marks.marks %}
{% if mk.area == "Face" %}
A tattoo is showing on your face: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }}).
{% elif mk.area == "Hands" %}
A tattoo is showing on your bare hands: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }}).
{% elif mk.area == "Feet" %}
A tattoo is showing on your bare feet: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }}).
{% elif mk.area == "Body" %}
A tattoo is showing on your exposed torso: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }}).
{% else %}
A tattoo is showing on your exposed skin: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }}).
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
## Who Is Nearby
{% if existsIn(marks, "marks") and isArray(marks.marks) %}
{{ default(marks.wearer, "The marked person") }} has visible tattoos:{% for mk in marks.marks %}{% if mk.area == "Face" %} one on their face: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }});{% elif mk.area == "Hands" %} one on their bare hands: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }});{% elif mk.area == "Feet" %} one on their bare feet: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }});{% elif mk.area == "Body" %} one on their exposed torso: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }});{% else %} one on their exposed skin: '{{ default(mk.name, "") }}' ({{ default(mk.section, "") }});{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
